## Interface: 16001
## Title: Ourix's Quest Handbook
## Notes: View quest chain relationships and details, showing each quest's current state.
## Notes-zhCN: 查看任务链关系和具体信息，显示当前的任务状态。
## Notes-zhTW: 查看任務鏈關係和具體資訊，顯示目前的任務狀態。
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\OurixsQuestHandbook\Media\Icon.png
## Author: Ourixs
## Version: 1.0.0
## DefaultState: enabled
## SavedVariables: OurixsQuestHandbookDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: OurixsQuestHandbookCharDB
## Dependencies: QuestieDB
## X-Runtime-Dependencies: QuestieDB

# Coordinate table only (AreaTable -> UiMapID). Not quest business data.
Core\AreaMap.lua

# Core: all pure native API wrappers, no libraries.
Core\Locale.lua
Core\QuestAPI.lua
Core\DataSource.lua
Core\Rewards.lua
Core\Collector.lua
Core\Chains.lua
Core\MapLink.lua

# UI: plain CreateFrame widgets, no Ace / LibDBIcon / etc.
UI\Widgets.lua
UI\QuestTooltip.lua
UI\CategoryTree.lua
UI\ChainView.lua
UI\MainWindow.lua
UI\MinimapButton.lua
UI\NpcChainPanel.lua
UI\SharePanel.lua

# Must be last: SavedVariables, events, slash commands, NPC panel hooks.
Core\Init.lua
